# The cases the PROGRAM LAYER fails where the old path passed, as of the spec harness's move onto it
# (shown / refused_with / refusals / refused_at_run / judged ask the layer, no net). Each is a law the
# layer lacks, a program it does not make, or an answer it gets wrong; `AVRA_SPEC_DIFFERENTIAL=1` and
# tools/spec_differential.py say which. THE LIST ONLY SHRINKS: take a line away the day its case passes.
# A case past a trap tools/gate/std-avrac.traps lists has never run on the layer and is not here: the
# lane that fixes a trap runs that file and pins or fixes what then reports.
